      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-purple-600 text-white rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
        <h3 class="heading-2 text-white mb-3">This Wednesday, 7:30pm</h3>
        <p class="text-blue-100 mb-6 max-w-xl mx-auto">Two clicks. Ninety minutes. One passage of Scripture. Bring your coffee.</p>
        <a href="tel:+27774871295" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-50">
          Call Now to Get the Link
